# The status panel's mouse (StatusWin_on_right_click and on_left_click, see statuswin.c): the menu on the right button over the
# square's picture (a menu of three: its feature or resource view, and the Datalinks), over the active unit and the unit icons (activate,
# select, help), over the base icon (zoom, production, hurry and the governor's four settings), and the choices; the left button on the
# picture (flips what it shows), on a unit icon (makes it the unit the player moves), and a double click (which does nothing). A base
# and a stack of three units are on the first unit's square; unit 6 is picked (sel_veh 0x8c6b24). The Datalinks screen the menu and Help
# open is closed with its EXIT button.
